# Secrets & local overrides for Looper.
#
# Credential lookup order (highest priority first):
#   1. Process environment variables
#   2. App-specific override: ~/.config/looper/.env (or apps/looper/.env in `pnpm dev`)
#   3. Shared dotfiles secrets: ~/.config/odysea/secrets.env (or $ODYSEA_SECRETS_FILE)
#
# Non-secret settings (port, timezone, google scopes/redirectUri) can live in
# ~/.config/looper/config.yaml (see config.example.yaml) so they can be committed to dotfiles.

# Google OAuth2 Credentials (optional — non-Google workflows run without these)
# Get these from the Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# Optional overrides (normally configured in ~/.config/looper/config.yaml)
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5050/oauth/callback
# GOOGLE_SCOPES=openid profile email https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.send
# PORT=5050
# TZ=Europe/Amsterdam
